.TH "libnvme" 9 "struct nvme_personality_properties" "October 2026" "API Manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
struct nvme_personality_properties \- Personality Properties data structure
.SH SYNOPSIS
struct nvme_personality_properties {
.br
.BI "    __u8 pps;"
.br
.BI "    __u8 perid;"
.br
.BI "    __u8 mrstt;"
.br
.BI "    __u8 aus;"
.br
.BI "    __u8 attrs;"
.br
.BI "
};
.br

.SH Members
.IP "pps" 12
Personality Properties Size: size in bytes of this data
structure.
.IP "perid" 12
Personality Identifier, see \fIenum nvme_personality_identifier\fP.
.IP "mrstt" 12
Minimum Required Reset Type, see \fIenum nvme_personality_mrstt\fP.
.IP "aus" 12
Authenticated Unfreeze Support, see \fIenum
nvme_personality_aus\fP. Cleared to 0h if this personality does
not support an authenticated unfreeze method, in which case a
frozen instance of this personality is permanently frozen.
.IP "attrs" 12
Personality Attributes, see \fIenum nvme_personality_attrs\fP.
